sequenceDiagram
  participant Caller as Caller / future application layer
  participant Core as libs/core
  participant Gateway as CareerEvidenceGateway
  participant Cmd as Tauri command
  participant Rust as career_evidence
  participant DB as SQLite

  Note over Caller,DB: Insert stores a new draft or proposal only
  Caller->>Core: draftCareerEvidence or proposeCareerEvidence
  Core-->>Caller: CareerEvidence
  Caller->>Gateway: insertCareerEvidence(evidence)
  Gateway->>Cmd: db_insert_career_evidence
  Cmd->>Rust: insert
  Rust->>DB: INSERT
  DB-->>Rust: row
  Rust-->>Gateway: raw persistence row
  Gateway->>Core: rehydrateCareerEvidence(row)
  Core-->>Gateway: nominal CareerEvidence
  Gateway-->>Caller: PersistedCareerEvidence

  Note over Caller,DB: Lifecycle save is one compare-and-set
  Caller->>Core: confirmCareerEvidence or rejectCareerEvidence
  Core-->>Caller: terminal CareerEvidence
  Caller->>Gateway: saveCareerEvidenceLifecycle(id, evidence)
  Gateway->>Cmd: db_save_career_evidence_lifecycle
  Cmd->>Rust: save lifecycle
  Rust->>DB: UPDATE WHERE id AND previous review_state AND unchanged columns
  alt rows updated is 1
    DB-->>Rust: terminal row
    Rust-->>Gateway: raw persistence row
    Gateway->>Core: rehydrateCareerEvidence(row)
    Core-->>Gateway: nominal CareerEvidence
    Gateway-->>Caller: PersistedCareerEvidence
  else rows updated is 0
    Rust->>DB: SELECT id
    DB-->>Rust: current row or none
    Rust-->>Gateway: not found, immutable-field error, or illegal transition
    Gateway-->>Caller: domain or persistence error
  end
